    "content": "<p><strong>路径</strong>：【首页】-左侧【设置】-【商户管理】-【商户信息】</p>\n<p><video src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202503/03d15b738daf1cae19ade7cfde78c2fa.mp4\" controls=\"controls\" class=\"my-video\" style=\"max-width:100%\">\n\n\n视频描述\n</video></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202309/f9c32dd4720ea4b10aaaf9e06b767db9.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>点击【修改】。依次填写对应信息，带*的为必填</p>\n<p><img src=\"blob:https://www.zhihuiji.cn/d5437bb6-fa3e-4f8d-a8f6-17e949b9bf06\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202211/3be748a83ee025305644fbcbc1a39cad.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>填写完毕后，点击【保存】</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202211/d25bcfb3ce114aa8620555a929b418ec.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"blob:https://www.zhihuiji.cn/73538bc8-fbb1-43a8-97dd-81c349952298\" alt=\"\"></p>\n",
